{
  "hookSpecificOutput": {
    "hookEventName": "PreToolUse",
    "additionalContext": "Memories this project recorded about this file:\n- [gotcha] Gradle `from(...)` in the jar task silently skips missing files, so renaming LICENSE files (now LICENSE.md and LICENSE-ATE.md) without updating build.gradle ships a jar without ATE's copyright notice; verify jar contents after such renames.\n- [gotcha] In ModularPlanters, `./gradlew clean build` wipes build/moddev, and rebuilding it requires downloading from launchermeta.mojang.com, so after a clean no Gradle task works offline; avoid running clean when the network may be unavailable."
  }
}

